IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ia-life-policy`

-- Insurance Act 1966, ss 146-149 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_insurance-act-1966_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `s 146 -- insurable interest`

`a policy on my own life` MEANS `My life policy` WITH
    `whose life is insured` IS `my own life`
    `issued by a licensed insurer` IS TRUE
    `issued before 1 January 1967` IS FALSE
    `issued before 1 March 2009` IS FALSE
    `I had an insurable interest in that life then` IS FALSE
    `the amount of my insurable interest then` IS 0
    `it meets every condition of s 146(3) or (4)` IS FALSE
    `the policy moneys` IS 500000

`a policy on my business partner worth 200000 to me` MEANS `My life policy` WITH
    `whose life is insured` IS `someone else`
    `issued by a licensed insurer` IS TRUE
    `issued before 1 January 1967` IS FALSE
    `issued before 1 March 2009` IS FALSE
    `I had an insurable interest in that life then` IS TRUE
    `the amount of my insurable interest then` IS 200000
    `it meets every condition of s 146(3) or (4)` IS FALSE
    `the policy moneys` IS 500000

`a policy on a stranger` MEANS `My life policy` WITH
    `whose life is insured` IS `someone else`
    `issued by a licensed insurer` IS TRUE
    `issued before 1 January 1967` IS FALSE
    `issued before 1 March 2009` IS FALSE
    `I had an insurable interest in that life then` IS FALSE
    `the amount of my insurable interest then` IS 0
    `it meets every condition of s 146(3) or (4)` IS FALSE
    `the policy moneys` IS 500000

`a trust policy taken by a trustee in 2015` MEANS `My life policy` WITH
    `whose life is insured` IS `someone else`
    `issued by a licensed insurer` IS TRUE
    `issued before 1 January 1967` IS FALSE
    `issued before 1 March 2009` IS FALSE
    `I had an insurable interest in that life then` IS FALSE
    `the amount of my insurable interest then` IS 0
    `it meets every condition of s 146(3) or (4)` IS TRUE
    `the policy moneys` IS 500000

`a trust policy taken by a trustee in 2005` MEANS `My life policy` WITH
    `whose life is insured` IS `someone else`
    `issued by a licensed insurer` IS TRUE
    `issued before 1 January 1967` IS FALSE
    `issued before 1 March 2009` IS TRUE
    `I had an insurable interest in that life then` IS FALSE
    `the amount of my insurable interest then` IS 0
    `it meets every condition of s 146(3) or (4)` IS TRUE
    `the policy moneys` IS 500000

`a policy on a stranger from an unlicensed insurer` MEANS `My life policy` WITH
    `whose life is insured` IS `someone else`
    `issued by a licensed insurer` IS FALSE
    `issued before 1 January 1967` IS FALSE
    `issued before 1 March 2009` IS FALSE
    `I had an insurable interest in that life then` IS FALSE
    `the amount of my insurable interest then` IS 0
    `it meets every condition of s 146(3) or (4)` IS FALSE
    `the policy moneys` IS 500000

#ASSERT `Is my life policy valid` `a policy on my own life` EQUALS `valid`
#ASSERT `Is my life policy valid` `a policy on my business partner worth 200000 to me` EQUALS `valid`
#ASSERT `Is my life policy valid` `a policy on a stranger` EQUALS `void for want of insurable interest`
#ASSERT `Is my life policy valid` `a trust policy taken by a trustee in 2015` EQUALS `valid`
#ASSERT `Is my life policy valid` `a trust policy taken by a trustee in 2005` EQUALS `void for want of insurable interest`
#ASSERT `Is my life policy valid` `a policy on a stranger from an unlicensed insurer` EQUALS `s 146 does not reach this policy`

#ASSERT `What is the most my life policy can pay` `a policy on my own life` EQUALS `the full policy moneys`
#ASSERT `What is the most my life policy can pay` `a policy on my business partner worth 200000 to me` EQUALS (`no more than my insurable interest` 200000)
#ASSERT `What is the most my life policy can pay` `a policy on a stranger` EQUALS `nothing: the policy is void`

§ `s 147 -- capacity of a young person`

#ASSERT `Can I take out insurance at my age` 16 FALSE EQUALS `I have capacity`
#ASSERT `Can I take out insurance at my age` 15 FALSE EQUALS `I lack capacity`
#ASSERT `Can I take out insurance at my age` 12 TRUE EQUALS `I have capacity`
#ASSERT `Can I take out insurance at my age` 9 FALSE EQUALS `I lack capacity`
#ASSERT `Can I take out insurance at my age` 9 TRUE EQUALS `s 147 does not decide it`

§ `s 148 -- deductions`

#ASSERT `May my insurer deduct this sum from what it pays me` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no, not without my consent`
#ASSERT `May my insurer deduct this sum from what it pays me` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS `yes, the deduction may be made`
#ASSERT `May my insurer deduct this sum from what it pays me` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 148 does not reach this policy`

§ `s 149 -- after 3 years`

`an endowment policy in force 3 years` MEANS `My policy's history` WITH
    `years in force, counting any earlier policy it replaced` IS 3
    `it secures an annuity for a term dependent on human life` IS FALSE
    `no policy moneys are necessarily payable under it` IS FALSE
    `it pays on a death after a specified period` IS FALSE

`an endowment policy in force 2 years` MEANS `My policy's history` WITH
    `years in force, counting any earlier policy it replaced` IS 2
    `it secures an annuity for a term dependent on human life` IS FALSE
    `no policy moneys are necessarily payable under it` IS FALSE
    `it pays on a death after a specified period` IS FALSE

`an annuity on my life in force 5 years` MEANS `My policy's history` WITH
    `years in force, counting any earlier policy it replaced` IS 5
    `it secures an annuity for a term dependent on human life` IS TRUE
    `no policy moneys are necessarily payable under it` IS FALSE
    `it pays on a death after a specified period` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `May I surrender my policy by written notice for its surrender value` `an endowment policy in force 3 years`
#ASSERT NOT `May I surrender my policy by written notice for its surrender value` `an endowment policy in force 2 years`
#ASSERT NOT `May I surrender my policy by written notice for its surrender value` `an annuity on my life in force 5 years`

